{"id":38867035445,"name":"Test","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAJDKflNQ","head_branch":"fix/ou-merge-keep-target-data_2.42.7","head_sha":"91c86d69fbc193a0641f6d34e0dcea02be22284b","path":".github/workflows/run-tests.yml","run_number":57486,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"backport: fix: Keep the target's data values and approvals in an org unit merge [DHIS2-22296]- #25746","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":10954,"check_suite_id":105329525284,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAYhiECJA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38867035445","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38867035445","created_at":"2026-10-16T07:24:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:40:58Z","run_started_at":"2026-10-16T07:24:39Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38867035445/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38867035445/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/105329525284","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38867035445/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38867035445/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/38867035445/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"backport: fix: Keep the target's data values and approvals in an org unit merge [DHIS2-22296] (#25746)\n\n* fix: Keep the target's data values and approvals in an org unit merge [DHIS2-22296] (#25734)\n\nWith the LAST_UPDATED strategy (the default, shown in Metadata Management\nas \"Move data values to the target organisation unit\") the merge first\ndeleted all of the target's data values and data approvals, then copied in\nthe most recent source rows only. Values only the target had were lost, and\nwhere both had a value the source always won, contrary to the UI's \"the\nmost recently updated is kept\". The deletes were hard deletes and were not\naudited.\n\nRank the target's own rows together with the sources' rows and upsert the\nwinners into the target, then delete the source rows. On a tie the target\nkeeps its own row; a tie between sources goes to the lowest org unit id so\nthe result is repeatable. Replayed on a copy of a production database:\ntarget 336 values -\u003e 349 (its own plus 13 new keys from the source), every\nkey holding the newest value from either side; previously 336 -\u003e 61.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted\n\n* fix: Keep the winning approval's last updated fields in an org unit merge [DHIS2-22296]\n\nThe LAST_UPDATED approval merge copied accepted, created and creator but\nnot lastupdated and lastupdatedby. A source approval that replaced a\ntarget approval kept the target's values for both, so the approval\nstatus reported the wrong acceptedBy and acceptedAt. An approval moved\nto the target without a conflict got null for both.\n\nCopy both columns from the winning row in the insert and in the upsert.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"91c86d69fbc193a0641f6d34e0dcea02be22284b","tree_id":"28c4e7e88ff9181956509dced9e5ccfc04ce5aeb","timestamp":"2026-10-16T07:23:26Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.